	(text "When the corresponding line counter is enabled\n,~{ODB5L}1 or ~{ODB5L}2, the x positions go from\n0..15, drawing every pixel of the 16 x 16 sprite\nobject to the active line buffer for drawing.\nWhen the line buffer toggles after ~{LBRST}\ngoes high the pixels are read and the\nx positions go from 0..239 during scroll/obj\nlayers active."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
